I look around the living room.
There is a nice desk near the window there.
That place is perfect for my work.
I put my large bag on a chair.
My laptop is inside the bag.
I take it out.
I place it carefully on the desk.
Now my laptop is placed on the desk.
My notebooks are in the bag.
I take them out too.
I arrange those notebooks neatly near the laptop.
A pen is under the notebooks.
I put that pen near the laptop.
Now all my things are on the desk.
My new workspace is ready.
I sit on the chair.
The breeze outside the window is very nice.
I like this corner a lot.
